<title>USA: Providence Energy to be listed on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Providence Energy to be listed on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Providence Energy Corp said on Thursday that it has filed an application to list its common stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Trading is expected to begin in early December under its current ticker symbol, PVY, the company said.</p>
<p>Providence Energy is an energy services company with operations in natural gas distribution and marketing.</p>
